[0.000, "o", "- **Assessment:** not ready.\r\n- **Fact:** 1/3 visible bugs match a configured blocker (#154).\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "## Blockers\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** #154 is open with `Highest` priority and the configured whiteboard marker.\r\n\r\n## Dependency risks\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 1 unresolved outgoing dependency (#152) blocks #154.\r\n\r\n## Stale or unowned work\r\n\r\n- **Fact:** 0 stale open bugs under the stated assumptions.\r\n- **Fact:** Ownership check: N/A (not selected).\r\n"]
