[0.000, "o", "## Data limitations\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n- **Fact:** Rolling snapshot, visible rows only. Deadline, ownership, milestone, status/resolution, history/regression, and custom-field evidence is N/A because those checks were not selected. Alternate saved-query, URL, milestone, and version reads verify the fixture only; the assessment uses the product scope alone.\r\n\r\n## Source commands\r\n\r\n```text\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> --json bug list --whiteboard bzr-release-readiness-demo-v1 --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,product,version,target_milestone,whiteboard\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> --json bug view 154 --fields id,product,version,target_milestone,whiteboard\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> --json query show release-readiness-demo-url\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> --json query show release-readiness-demo\r\nbzr --server <server-profile> --json bug search --from-url <credential-free-url> --limit 100 --paginate --sort bug_id --order asc --fields id,summary,status,priority,severity,keywords,flags,depends_on,last_change_time,"]
